The adjacent o200k_base.tiktoken is the public encoding resource used by
OpenAI's tiktoken. It is bundled so token counting works without a network
request or a pre-existing user cache.

Source: https://openaipublic.blob.core.windows.net/encodings/o200k_base.tiktoken
Upstream definition: https://github.com/openai/tiktoken/blob/main/tiktoken_ext/openai_public.py
Expected SHA-256: 446a9538cb6c348e3516120d7c08b09f57c36495e2acfffe59a5bf8b0cfb1a2d
Upstream license: https://github.com/openai/tiktoken/blob/main/LICENSE

